// Panel: "Peak Hours: Avg kWh by Hour of Day"  - Table, Format as: Table.  OWNER: Part 3
// One row per hour of the day (Toronto local time), one column per appliance.
// Each cell = that appliance's average kWh in that hour across the selected range.
// Shown as a heatmap with Cell type = Colored background (gradient, Green-Yellow-Red);
// the "hour" column has an override (Cell type Auto, Unit Misc > Number).
EnergyHourly
| where $__timeFilter(ts)
| extend hour = hourofday(datetime_utc_to_local(ts, "America/Toronto"))
| summarize kwh = avg(avg_w) / 1000.0 by hour, appliance
| evaluate pivot(appliance, sum(kwh))
| order by hour asc
